---
title: "Idea to merged: the skill pipeline"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: exec
    lg1: done
    lg2: Breaks NoSleepingFrontier in some cases
    lg3: Path to the NoSleepingFrontier bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 pink
  class lg2 mayBreak
  class lg3 bugPath
  s0: Tickets ready, maestro asleep
  s1: bcheck working a ticket
  s2: Maestro dispatching
  s3: bcheck planning with you
  s4: A worker is running
  s5: Tickets filed
  s6: needs-help: waiting on the master
  s7: bcheck's full-send is asking you
  s8: Last ticket merged, closing out
  s9: Merged
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you run bcheck and it claims a ticket
  s0 --> s2: someone nudges the maestro
  s1 --> s1: bcheck judges it ready or bcheck implements and hands over to full-send or someone nudges the maestro or maestro finds nothing to do and pauses its heartbeat
  s1 --> s3: bcheck judges it needs planning
  s2 --> s1: you run bcheck and it claims a ticket
  s2 --> s4: maestro claims a ticket and starts a worker
  s4 --> s5: worker merges the PR
  s4 --> s6: worker labels needs-help
  s3 --> s1: you approve the plan
  s1 --> s7: full-send asks the user
  s1 --> s5: full-send merges the PR and closes the issue
  s5 --> s8: maestro closes the epic, every sub-issue is closed
  s7 --> s1: you answer full-send
  s6 --> s5: master finishes the ticket by hand
  s6 --> s2: master removes needs-help
  s8 --> s9: every ticket is merged
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 teal
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 teal
  class s3 teal
  class s4 teal
  class s5 teal
  class s5 mayBreak
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 teal
  class s7 teal
  class s8 teal
  class s9 pink
